## Working with awf

This guide, the four repository-local `awf-*` skills, and managed docs render from [awf](https://github.com/hypnotox/agentic-workflows) configuration in `.awf/`; change generated sources, run `./awf render` and `./awf check`, and commit generated outputs with their sources. Install [agentic-skills](https://github.com/hypnotox/agentic-skills) globally for generic skills and roles. Pi users install `pi-tools` separately for role delegation. AWF does not install or probe either dependency. See [{{ .layout.workingWithAwf }}]({{ .layout.workingWithAwf }}) for ownership, rendering, and commands.
<!-- awf:end -->

